gnR(){return"Download & apply"},
gnQ(){return'Tap "Download" next to the model you want and wait for it to finish \u2014 the first model you download is automatically set active. If you have multiple variants installed, tap "Set active" to switch anytime; tap the trash icon to remove a model you no longer need to free up space.'},
