gq6(){return"TruthLens does not collect any data linked to your identity, and does not use any data for tracking, so it does not require App Tracking Transparency (ATT) permission."},
gq7(){return"This app uses the system file picker to access files or images you actively choose; it cannot access files you haven't selected (enforced by the iOS App Sandbox)."},
gpZ(){return"TruthLens does not collect personal data and does not share user data with any third party."},
gq_(){return"This app only accesses storage when you actively choose to import a file or image; it does not scan or access other files in the background."},
gq9(){return"TruthLens runs under macOS App Sandbox and can only access files you actively selected via the system file dialog (files.user-selected.read-write) \u2014 it cannot browse or access any other files or folders on its own."},
gqa(){return"Network access (network.client) is used only for the necessary connections listed below."},
gqs(){return"TruthLens is a standalone desktop app; data is stored in your local user folder (e.g. AppData/Documents) and is never synced to the cloud."},
